      "message": "In our naming convention, macros should be named in all capital letters:\n\nhttps://google.github.io/styleguide/cppguide.html#Macro_Names\n\nAlternative fix: I suggest we just call `setjmp` in the `ctrl_set_reference()` functions in av1_cx_iface.c and av1_dx_iface.c. You can use the following code in av1_cx_iface.c (which calls `setjmp` for the `av1_change_config()` call) as an example:\n\n```\n    struct aom_internal_error_info *const error \u003d cpi-\u003ecommon.error;\n    if (setjmp(error-\u003ejmp)) {\n      error-\u003esetjmp \u003d 0;\n      return error-\u003eerror_code;\n    }\n    error-\u003esetjmp \u003d 1;\n    av1_change_config(cpi, \u0026ctx-\u003eoxcf, is_sb_size_changed);\n    error-\u003esetjmp \u003d 0;\n```\n\nand then change `av1_set_reference_dec()` to call `aom_internal_error()`.",
